# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Legacy Wix → new site  ·  301 permanent redirects
#
# Preserves Google rankings and inbound links after the fdp.org cutover from
# the old Wix site. Old URLs were taken from the Wix sitemaps:
#   /pages-sitemap.xml  and  /blog-posts-sitemap.xml
#
# These rules fire on whatever domain Netlify serves, so they also cover the
# old domain IF foodservicedesignprofessionals.com is added as a domain alias
# on this Netlify site (recommended — see docs/redirects.md).
#
# Netlify evaluates top-to-bottom, first match wins. Keep specific rules above
# the wildcards. `301` = permanent (passes ranking signal to the new URL).
# Note: /about is intentionally NOT redirected — the new site serves its own
# About page there, which is the better match for that slug.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

